    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vulwaye kandi lihona liu mwami Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'inga yene yeyo, mwami Hezekia yaali mulwaye kali kuduuka ahimbi ku likuza. Muporofeti Isaya mwana wa Amozi yazia kumulora, kandi namuvolera, “Yahova avoora, ulungikize vindu viosi kigira siulahona mba, navuzwa ulakuza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku mwami Hezekia yagirung'ana nahenza ku lidigi ma nasaara navoora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“O, Yahova, unzizurize kigira inzi mali kukutumikira nu vusuuvirifu vwosi, kandi mali kokora agaveeye amalahi imbiri woovo nu mwoyo gwange gwosi kazozo.” Mwami Hezekia yalira vululu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Yahova yalaga Muporofeti Isaya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwirana ku Hezekia kumuvolera ndi, “Inzi Yahova, Nyasaye wa guuga woovo Daudi, mali kuhulira lisaala liilio kandi mali kolola maliga googo; ndakomeeda mihiga 15 mu limenya liilio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakosoora harara ni lidaala linene lia Jerusalemi kutura ku mwami wi kivala cha Asiria kandi ndazizagilira kukinga lidaala linene yili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muporofeti Isaya yavolera mwami Hezekia avugule amakuyu gaduvuliywi aviiki ku mavimba na aduuki kohona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku mwami Hezekia yateeva, “Ni kelolekizu ki kimanyia ndi inzi ndazia kusigamira Yahova mu Litembeli?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Zimbaso yizi ziasuundwa ahimbi nu luvaso lwa 6: kigira makuva gaveeye muzio gaveeye harara.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya yativura navoora, “Yahova alakuha kelolekizu kukumanyia ndi aladuukiza lisuuvizwa lilie ku ivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova alakola chiriri kwirana inyima ivika 10, kungasi yalombwa nu mwami Ahazi.” Hene yaho, chiriri chirana inyima vika 10.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lwimbu lwi Lizominya lwu Mwami Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wu mwami Hezekia yaali ni yakahona kutura mu vulwaye vwivwe, yang'oda lwimbu lwi lizominya yilu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
